<Base title="Documentation — Deployz">
  <h1>Documentation</h1>
  <p>Deployz deploys and operates your application inside each customer's AWS account.</p>

  <h2>Getting started</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Connect your application.</strong> Define the deployment: container image, database, and environment settings.</li>
    <li><strong>Create an install link.</strong> The customer uses the link to install your product into their AWS account.</li>
    <li><strong>Operate.</strong> Deployz monitors, upgrades, and diagnoses every deployment.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Requirements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Each customer needs an AWS account.</li>
    <li>The application must use the supported deployment architecture.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="note">
    <p>These docs are a placeholder for the MVP. More content will follow.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
